{"lyrics":"[Intro: Juice WRLD & Yuna]\n[00:03.92]Yeah\n[00:04.78]I want us forever\n[00:06.52]I want you forever\n[00:07.26]I want this forever\n[00:09.22](DRMZ, you a fool for this one)\n[00:13.60]I love you, listen\n[00:14.18](\n[00:14.24]Forever in my mind, only you\n[00:15.50])\n[00:15.52](\n[00:15.60]The pieces in my life go away with you\n[00:16.84]) I really care for you\n[00:17.56](\n[00:17.64]Forever in my mind, only you\n[00:18.24]) I really do\n[00:18.74](\n[00:18.88]The pieces in my life\n[00:19.60]) Listen (\n[00:19.96]Go away with you\n[00:20.44])\n[00:20.46](\n[00:20.54]Forever in my mind, only you\n[00:21.74])\n[Verse 1: Juice WRLD]\n[00:21.80]Forever, forever\n[00:22.14]She stay on my mind like forever, forever (Forever, forever)\n[00:25.22]For worse or for better\n[00:26.10]I'm willing to fight for her heart, it's a pleasure (I really am)\n[00:29.70]Hope she get the message\n[00:31.06]I swear she an angel, that's word back to Heaven (That's word to God)\n[00:33.30]Man, fuck all the stressing and fighting\n[00:35.24]I want you forever, forever (I want you forever)\n[00:41.36]I'm writing these verses\n[00:43.52]Rehearse it, record it and play it at your request (And play it at your request)\n[00:47.04]I feel like it's us two forever\n[00:48.96]But I think that we just don't know it yet (Don't think that we know it yet)\n[00:53.10]I swear life is a bitch\n[00:54.04]I'ma toss it a bone, 'cause I feel like it's playing fetch (I feel like it's playing fetch)\n[00:56.96]You keepin' my heart or you tossin' it?\n[00:58.40]Baby, I know I hate playing catch (You know I hate playing catch)\n[01:00.78]Forever, forever\n[01:01.62]Say that no matter no weather (Right)\n[01:03.30]Heart getting colder than winter\n[01:04.72]But I say, \"No matter the weather,\" and don't you forget it (Right)\n[01:07.92]I look at love and then have all these questions (Right)\n[01:09.42]I look at you and then get all these answers (Right)\n[01:11.02]Fuck all these hoes, can you please mind my manners? (Right)\n[01:12.78]Monkey around, 'cause you drive me bananas (Right)\n[01:14.82]You put the nails to my hammer\n[01:15.84]Without you, I'm deadly like cancer, think of your answer\n[01:17.82]I feel like it's us and the planet and baby, I'm not being antsy\n[01:20.38]I'm just hoping you understand me\n[01:22.10]Look what you do to me, this is so crazy, yeah\n[01:24.20]I'm happy to call you my lady, yeah\n[01:25.46]I'm happy to say we together\n[01:27.20]And I hope this shit last forever, forever, yeah\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD & Yuna]\n[01:30.00](\n[01:30.14]Forever in my mind, only you\n[01:31.60]The pieces in my life go away with you\n[01:32.94]) Yeah\n[01:33.08](\n[01:33.14]Forever in my mind, o-o-only you\n[01:34.06])\n[01:34.14]I love you\n[01:34.38](\n[01:34.50]The pieces in my life go-go-go away with you\n[01:36.48])\n[01:36.56]I hope you feelin' this as much as I am\n[01:37.56](\n[01:37.62]Forever in my mind, only you\n[01:39.04])\n[01:39.10]Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah\n[01:39.70](\n[01:39.76]The pieces in my life go away with you\n[01:40.96])\n[01:41.04]Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah\n[01:41.66](\n[01:41.76]Forever in my mind, only you\n[01:43.64])\n[01:44.64]It's really crazy how I feel about you\n[01:46.66](\n[01:46.76]The pieces in my life go away with you\n[01:49.62])\n[01:49.68]This one finna get personal though, check (\n[01:51.82]Mind\n[01:51.90])\n[Verse 2: Juice WRLD]\n[01:51.96]I'm losin' my mind\n[01:52.50]I'm losin' my mind, you drivin' me crazy (\n[01:54.20]Mind\n[01:54.58]; I'm goin' insane)\n[01:55.04]The shit we got into\n[01:55.74]The shit that we been through, shit, life is amazing (I swear, life is amazing) I'm not going nowhere\n[02:00.38]You not going nowhere, so baby, just face it\n[02:02.62]You're perfectly perfect for me\n[02:04.02]Baby, I'm able to actually give you this label, my queen\n[02:06.40]Girl, you deserve it\n[02:07.06]We been through our bullshit but, girl, it was worth it\n[02:08.90]I found Mrs. Right, I can't do no more searchin'\n[02:10.90]Fuck all the clownin' shit, this not a circus\n[02:12.48]I love for a reason, I love for a purpose\n[02:14.92]Wasn't an accident, this is on purpose\n[02:16.40]Put that on God, I can't do no more merchin' (No)\n[02:18.46]Don't turn your back, I can't take no more hurtin' (No)\n[02:20.08]Baby, I swear your love get me the highest\n[02:21.42]I look down below and I think that I'm flying (Yeah)\n[02:22.96]But really I'm falling, falling in love with you (Yeah)\n[02:25.20]Girl, it's because of you, girl, you the finest (Yeah)\n[02:27.66]Searching for love and you just helped me find it (Yeah)\n[02:30.62]Let's leave the bullshit and garbage behind us (Yeah)\n[02:33.64]Fuck the mistakes, let's not let them remind us\n[02:40.18]'Cause we at the top and let's do some more climbing\n[02:41.38]Girl, at this point, I'm pretty sure now you know just what you do to me\n[02:43.86]This shit that's new to me, girl\n[02:45.78]Finding my way through this jungle of life and it's foolery\n[02:49.22]So just get used to me, girl\n[02:53.18]I'm new to relationships, usually girls be abusing me\n[03:00.96]They just be using me, girl\n[03:01.98]This got me thinking forever, no matter no weather\n[03:03.46]That it's gon' be you and me, girl (Yeah)\n[Outro: Juice WRLD & Yuna]\n[03:04.38](\n[03:04.48]Forever in my mind, only you\n[03:05.42])\n[03:05.52]Yeah\n[03:05.68](\n[03:05.74]The pieces in my life go away with you\n[03:07.52])\n[03:07.58]Yeah\n[03:07.68](\n[03:07.78]Forever in my mind, only you\n[03:08.90])\n[03:08.96]Yeah, yeah\n[03:09.16](\n[03:09.24]The pieces in my life go away with you\n[03:10.12])\n[03:10.18]And that's how I feel, for real\n[03:10.98](\n[03:11.06]Forever in my mind, only you\n[03:11.90]The pieces in my life go away with you\n[03:12.82])\n[03:12.88]I love you\n[03:13.22](\n[03:13.34]Forever in my mind, only you\n[03:15.18]The pieces in my life go away with you\n[03:16.52])\n[03:16.58]I love you\n[03:16.78](\n[03:16.84]Forever in my mind\n[03: